delivery_ref: docs/supreme/specs/2026-09-15-echo-agent-sdk-independent-repository/plans/delivery-map.md#sdk-source-import
todos:
  - id: freeze-sdk-source-snapshot
    summary: 记录源 echo-agent 当前 SDK-owned 文件、当前未提交 SDK diff 和目标 framework
      revision，形成可复核的迁移输入，不修改源工作树。
    files:
      - echo-agent/echo-sdk-protocol/
      - echo-agent/echo-sdk-host/
      - echo-agent/contracts/sdk/
      - echo-agent/sdks/
      - echo-agent/docs/sdk/
      - echo-agent/scripts/
      - echo-agent/.github/workflows/
    acceptance:
      - 迁移清单覆盖 SDK crate、合同、三语言源码、文档、脚本、CI 与配置；源工作树 status、HEAD 和用户未提交修改保持不变。
  - id: initialize-independent-sdk-repository
    summary: 从新仓库初始 commit 建立 SDK 任务分支并导入完整 SDK-owned 路径，保留可追溯历史和独立仓库
      README/AGENTS/许可证入口。
    files:
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/
      - echo-agent/
    acceptance:
      - echo-agent-sdk 独立 clone 不依赖 ../echo-agent 路径即可看到完整 SDK 产品目录；历史可通过原
        echo-agent commit 和导入映射追溯。
  - id: preserve-as-is-build-boundary
    summary: 完成最小独立构建边界适配：SDK Host 依赖使用可解析的 framework source pin
      或明确迁移占位，protocol/合同/语言资产原样保留，暂不处理已知治理漂移。
    files:
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/Cargo.toml
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/Cargo.lock
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/echo-sdk-protocol/Cargo.toml
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/echo-sdk-host/Cargo.toml
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/README.md
    acceptance:
      - Cargo metadata、protocol crate dependency inspection
        和目录完整性检查可在独立仓库执行；不能通过的 full contract/language gate 明确记录为后续
        sdk-clean-framework-pin，不伪造通过。
  - id: commit-and-push-source-import
    summary: 在独立 SDK 仓库非 main 任务分支提交原样迁移结果并推送，留下源 revision、迁移清单和后续治理入口。
    files:
      - /Users/ls/MyWork/code/ylp_agent_learn/echo-agent-sdk/
    acceptance:
      - 提交关闭 GPG 签名，任务分支已推送；git ls-remote 与本地 commit 一致，SDK 仓库工作树 clean。
